<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 6.00 trln rbls of bonds July 9.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 6.00 trln rbls of bonds July 9.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will auction 4.00 trillion roubles in an additional 686-day tranche of series 24013 OFZ interest-bearing bonds and 2.00 trillion roubles in an additional 1067-day tranche of series 25016 bonds on July 9, the Central Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>  Series number		   24013</p>
<p>    Issue volume		    4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denomination		    1.00 million</p>
<p>    Original issue date	   May 28, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor			     686 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		   May 26, 1999</p>
<p>    Series number		   25016</p>
<p>    Issue volume		    2.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denomination		    1.00 million</p>
<p>    Original issue date	   July 10, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor			     1,067 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		   June 10, 2000</p>
<p>On July 9 the Finance Ministry will also repay 4.59 trillion roubles in a maturing issue of 18-month series 24005 OFZ bond, as well as 354.39 billion roubles in interest on the bond.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
